            "guid": "plex://collection/67c05dc44c2bebfe5e4b7757",
            "key": "/library/collections/67c05dc44c2bebfe5e4b7757/children",
            "summary": "After surviving a kidnapping in New York, Marfil, a wealthy twenty-year-old heiress, is forced to live under the constant watch of Sebastian Moore, a bodyguard as handsome as he is impassive. Despite her reservations, an intense and forbidden attraction develops between them. However, Marfil soon discovers that Sebastian is hiding dark secrets and that her own father is involved in a dangerous criminal underworld. Caught in a web of family betrayals and deadly threats, she must determine whether Sebastian will be her downfall or her only hope for survival.  A high-stakes romance blending bodyguard fiction and dark thriller, told in two volumes.",
